<import src="../../experience/public-display.wxml" />
<import src="../../identity-privacy/view.wxml" />
<import src="../../community/trading-summary.wxml" /><import src="../../community/saved-recovery.wxml" />
<view class="screen"><view class="eyebrow">WHALEU · 我的收藏</view><view class="title">收藏的帖子</view><view class="notice">按最近收藏时间排列，包含你当前有权查看的各地区帖子与急出交易。切换浏览校园不会删除收藏；隐藏或不可查看的内容不展示。</view><view class="status" aria-role="status">{{status}}</view><view wx:if="{{identityOverlay.notice}}" class="notice">{{identityOverlay.notice}}</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><button bindtap="onReload" disabled="{{busy || savedMutation.busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">刷新收藏</button><button wx:if="{{busy}}" bindtap="onCancel">停止等待</button><navigator wx:if="{{!hasSession}}" class="link" url="/pages/login/login">登录后查看自己的收藏 →</navigator><template is="saved-recovery" data="{{savedMutation}}" />
<view wx:if="{{loaded}}" class="meta">最新查询可查看的收藏：{{visibleSavedCount}} 条。已加载的分页并非固定快照；其他设备的取消／重新收藏可能改变条数和顺序，请刷新确认。</view><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="saveEpochId" class="card"><view class="author"><text wx:if="{{item.post.author.kind === 'named'}}" class="link" data-id="{{item.post.id}}" bindtap="onAuthor">{{item.post.author.displayName}} →</text><text wx:else>{{item.post.author.displayName}}</text><template wx:if="{{item.post.author.kind === 'named'}}" is="public-experience-display" data="{{display:item.post.author.experienceDisplay,colors:experienceColorStyles}}" /><text class="badge">{{item.post.author.kind === 'anonymous' ? '匿名' : '公开身份'}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.post.viewer.isSelf}}" class="badge">我</text></view><view class="meta">{{item.post.space.name}} · 收藏于 {{item.savedAt}}</view><view class="body">{{item.post.text}}</view><template wx:if="{{identityOverlay.developerEnabled}}" is="identity-overlay" data="{{identity:identityOverlay.items[item.post.id]}}" /><template wx:if="{{item.post.trading}}" is="trading-summary" data="{{listing:item.post.trading,tradingLabels}}" /><view wx:if="{{item.post.component.kind === 'poll'}}" class="notice">投票：{{item.post.component.poll.question}} · {{item.post.component.poll.expired ? '已结束' : '进入帖子参与'}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.post.component.kind === 'formation'}}" class="notice">组队：{{item.post.component.formation.theme}} · {{item.post.component.formation.memberCount}} / {{item.post.component.formation.capacity}} 人</view><view wx:if="{{item.post.images.length}}" class="notice">图片暂不可用，等待安全下载接入</view><view class="meta">{{item.post.saveCount}} 收藏 · {{item.post.likeCount}} 赞 · {{item.post.commentCount}} 条根评论 · {{item.post.replyCount}} 条回复 · 共 {{item.post.discussionCount}} 条讨论</view><navigator class="link" url="/pages/community-detail/community-detail?postId={{item.post.id}}">查看帖子与独立更新设置 →</navigator><button data-id="{{item.post.id}}" bindtap="onUnsave" disabled="{{busy || savedMutation.busy || savedMutation.frozen || !item.post.viewer.canSave}}">取消收藏</button></view><view wx:if="{{loaded &amp;&amp; !items.length}}" class="empty">暂无当前可查看的收藏</view><button wx:if="{{canLoadMore}}" bindtap="onMore" disabled="{{busy || savedMutation.busy}}">加载更多收藏</button><view class="notice">社区更新仅展示服务端已生成的站内记录；新更新是否生成取决于当前环境能力。收藏开关仅控制收藏帖新根评论；外部通知尚未接入，开启偏好不代表订阅同意或设备授权。</view><navigator class="link" url="/pages/community-updates/community-updates">查看社区更新 →</navigator><navigator class="link" url="/pages/community-feed/community-feed">回到社区 →</navigator></view>
